## Notes

KIRA was developed as an academic group project within the MSc in Aeronautical Engineering at **Politecnico di Milano**.

The Executive Summary reflects multidisciplinary team work. My primary contribution covered **team leadership, aircraft-level integration, mission and system architecture, preliminary sizing, multidisciplinary coordination and design decision-making**.
